# The same entry as copy-order-metamorph-beside-essence-of-the-wild-own-copy-
# first, but its controller applies Essence of the Wild's replacement first
# (index 1). Metamorph becomes a 6/6 copy of Essence, whose own definition has
# no Metamorph replacement left: no confirmation and no Bonesplitter choice
# is ever asked.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 3 U
tapformana human 4 U
tapformana human 5 U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue payphyrexian false
queue replacement 1
castspell human 1
resolvestack
